"command ``showAnalyzer`` should be added to ``upload_flags`` option, e.g.:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../plus/debug-tools/renode_extra.rst:85
msgid "Redirecting peripherals output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../plus/debug-tools/renode_extra.rst:87
msgid ""
"It might be useful to redirect output from device peripherals to a more "
"convenient communication channel. A typical example is redirecting UART "
"output to a socket which can be opened by :ref:`cmd_device_monitor` while "
"using Renode as the debug tool. The default debug flags can be overridden "
"using the ``debug_server`` option. For example, the following configuration "
"can be used to redirect output from the ``UART0`` port on the ``hifive1-"
"revb`` board:"
msgstr ""

